Rule 3 (A must have a supported dtype: float32, float64, complex64, or complex128)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
>>
Rule 4 (out, if provided, must be a complex tensor)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10
>>
Rule 5 (out shape must match the eigenvalues shape implied by A)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = ndim(v_1) - 1 ∧ (if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, i)) ∧ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1)
>>
Rule 6 (out dtype must match the eigenvalue dtype implied by A)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (if dtype_(v_1) = 7 then dtype_(v_2) = 9) ∧ (if dtype_(v_1) = 8 then dtype_(v_2) = 10) ∧ (if dtype_(v_1) = 9 then dtype_(v_2) = 9) ∧ (if dtype_(v_1) = 10 then dtype_(v_2) = 10)
